    "SU_0020": {
      "label": "Cojang",
      "type": "volume",
      "definition": "Measure of weight, 1 koyang of rice is approximately 1750 kilograms, in Batavia it was 27-28 pikol; varied according to the area and the type of product, commonly about 3500 Dutch pounds or 1700 kilograms; for salt it was 40 pikul or 2420 kilograms, in the 17th century the VOC counted 1 koyang for 23 pikul, later 32 pikul. Weight of 30 pikul were approximately 1500 -2000 kilograms."
    },
